    "title": "Manchester United's Tactical System Under Scrutiny",
    "text": "• Manchester United's recent cup exit has led to increased scrutiny of the manager's tactical system.\n• Concerns have been raised about the impact of this system on player morale and future prospects.\n• Managers are advised to adapt tactics to the league's physicality and competition.\n• A successful system in one environment may not work in another, necessitating adaptability and player development.\n• Questions have been raised about whether a rigid tactical system is hindering the development of young players like Mainoo and Garnacho.",
